  "notes": [
    "Reset is the Registry's votingAddress pointer to the governance executor, set minutes after the governance deployment; the passed proposal could grant wallet access only through it. FST records snapshot balances as designed and its 2022 upgrade left snapshot()/balanceOfAt unchanged, so FST is not a target.",
    "Campaign covers both actors: 0xcd7c839c's proposal execution and Wallet drains, and 0x81801a4e's proposal-12 flash vote, executor takeover and drains on Ethereum and Avalanche. Its proposals 10, 11 and 13 and the first actor's proposal 9 were never executed and moved nothing.",
    "Loss counts the USDC that FSDPT was redeemed for (not FSDPT itself) and the FST/WETH pair's WETH taken by selling FST minted through the captured executor; bridge proceeds, fees and FST dilution are excluded. The governance implementation is unverified; the defect is established from traces."
